{"job_id":"F-bf129d02bb05dfc8acb5","family_id":"F-bf129d02bb05dfc8acb5","title":"공군방공관제사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":10,"target_id":"ee80cbe0bfe1aee5ca6de544cd9288118928b93221abd569f72150c21d2a168c","source_hash":"e8635ac5c6435a21969c155e23f418c40533d6c16be274e8cf634c3cb4cc6e4b","text":"空军防空司令部命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":163,"target_id":"738c4f934ef813b820154e6c053e8210590dcad694c7cea6a260a590cfb95222","source_hash":"bb46a0737a8f1c3677c87323d454a3797ea12564f2bc7df63d79bc56e8f69a6b","text":"第一条（设施和任务）\n① 在空军内设立空军防空司令部（以下简称“司令部”），履行与防空控制相关的职责，如空中监视、预警和飞机拦截控制。\n该指挥部负责监督下属或指定部队的作战、训练和军事管理事宜。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":163,"end":229,"target_id":"769d98a7d4cb13815bb25ef71fb8cd84f242b4d05c94d0ed8eeee2923f37635d","source_hash":"42504033834e29d72655e70b2edf486b3a117d20ddf6c9439718307b01faacaa","text":"第二条（管辖权）本司令部的作战和训练管辖权由空军作战司令部司令决定，军事行政管辖权由空军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":229,"end":367,"target_id":"2ce958ee54f7a28a56d784a15cb2ddcb093c6fa6ba51d1de457db6f76917c08e","source_hash":"44831ab81ce0089c90ad423d1d9e943a10838d42694886d13735432f55d469ee","text":"第三条（指挥官等）\n① 司令部设司令官、副司令官和参谋长。\n司令官应从空军将官中任命，副司令官应从空军将官或校级军官中任命，参谋长应从空军校级军官中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":367,"end":558,"target_id":"dced75e4085a2f655f306867f9dd8a285dc4b16e1a6edb2eae89b8f0839a5398","source_hash":"cac5a365eded8985ad2ed88032b2d584280dfe60df4290c4b0254b719a85d67c","text":"第四条（指挥官等的职责）\n① 司令官在空军作战司令部司令的命令下，监督司令部的作战行动，并指挥和监督司令部的下属或附属部队。\n副指挥官协助指挥官，并在指挥官因不可避免的情况无法履行职责时代表指挥官行事。\n③ 参谋长协助司令官，并在司令官的命令下协调和控制参谋事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":558,"end":671,"target_id":"7b174057d9d5e58f0e09b8e49d27ce5d44930cac85985c8cd09757d83ce96955","source_hash":"69031b4d4cded54ed772610ad29f1ca9add4d7c43633c82ccb07e09eab6b417c","text":"第五条（维护军纪）司令官应当维护和执行空军参谋长根据第二条确定的管辖区域内空军部队的军纪（空军参谋长特别指定的空军部队除外）。<2018年12月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":671,"end":903,"target_id":"c07dc3909323c27c4151d67aa5280a0986dcc033c7eeebbc1f4f1a7aef065a93","source_hash":"21a86ca12910c5b7306eaab99e11dc63167f260e43ad88ec89061abe83720f9a","text":"第六条（紧急军事措施等）\n① 在因军事或灾害原因需要采取紧急措施的情况下，司令员可以临时指挥和监督位于空军作战司令部司令根据第2条指定的管辖区域内的非下属或附属单位。\n② 如果指挥官指挥或监督的单位不是根据第 1 款规定隶属于或分配的单位，则他/她应当立即向空军作战司令部司令报告情况，并通知相关单位的上级单位司令。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":903,"end":988,"target_id":"852e5a681e14988557503621637804bfd37dc14b8c75d0b282f908d22984da5b","source_hash":"a08d30db690be389a504be939851a06ea18dc6598d7f1f8b9113f6e323e7c3a6","text":"第七条（指挥部搬迁的事先批准）  如果指挥官因军事需要或灾害需要而打算搬迁指挥部，他/她应当事先获得空军作战司令部司令的批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":988,"end":1112,"target_id":"b219d077d639662a5f3053860cb546db8e34d397b9e9708958d9d13d63b22ed7","source_hash":"2a47f8239aedece0b353ec593c19d1b8e7b66aa20a2d6c674fe6219a1f5d98e3","text":"第八条（单位和部门的设立）\n① 在总部内建立必要的参谋部门和单位。\n② 根据第1款，有关参谋部门的设立和职责划分的事项，由空军参谋长决定；有关部队的设立、任务和组织事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1112,"end":1155,"target_id":"905cadf8dcf322e275237d45de6eb7a442fd9aaf21947fb3b97f66169f489c64","source_hash":"32a41646161c44c4f6d70a2ddae62ef6a423c7e1e64277d4e3123efc3173a183","text":"第九条（人员配额）驻扎在指挥部的军事人员和文职人员的人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1155,"end":1179,"target_id":"edca535fb3a1d8dc91add78a5f3e4ca880e9732359cc8f5e98d4c0c2c6fa4a28","source_hash":"715d57151189994468bcf08eef5c78f04872d6be3c5c6c8a874bce7bcf82d0ae","text":"补充规定 <第24579号，2013年6月11日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1179,"end":1208,"target_id":"eb761fb837f943c299cae04ff56576f8a6621988fa7a674800d5f3fbd19a3e21","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1208,"end":1311,"target_id":"be7aa432bee41766658d91321b26123756c70f03d021bfe94790fcc634579bbd","source_hash":"fbc8890236f3bdf270f3c90df5d312a74393f2d7b24d0a98b252e63790870b28","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）对《军事人员法》实施令的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第 13 条第 1 款第 1 项（c）款中的“和空军战斗机联队司令”应改为“空军防空管制司令部司令兼空军战斗机联队司令”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1311,"end":1344,"target_id":"422dce94b87632586e4e6896f51e50455e54952bf2cf8e4c39fbd5a4c3629a31","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1344,"end":1381,"target_id":"61ac24f142e84b4f691023c6b99038fe46b4c2e46b3cec8bddc3f402c2c5434e","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1381,"end":1395,"target_id":"99d6b12634494c2da065978a9218ea0b8586fbba51d09c924ec37eb5770978b0","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第 2 条和第 3 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1395,"end":1548,"target_id":"4c7c2192534b36787781c2e84cde624e811e62103d127284da93cba3b828d8a4","source_hash":"56e3048cd038f2dfc67706d85a9879e3eb32692584c004c8bf6c9cbc91b4c737","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至⑥ 省略\n\n  ⑦ 空军防空司令部命令的部分内容修订如下。\n\n  在第三条第二款中，“作为将军”应改为“作为将军”，“作为将军或”应改为“作为将军或”。\n\n  省略⑧至<90>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1548,"end":1580,"target_id":"93db59fe6f0954770c915e7e450fa716e6d4d5b5fc5fb95f96941dc60e8a1abf","source_hash":"de588adf60e2b9ab1eae09f068dfaec85007d837e2e47e4243decc39ddef51a7","text":"附录（作战指挥令）<编号 29321，2018 年 12 月 4 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1580,"end":1615,"target_id":"7cbfdfe0d34032eecee69bb9fb8b2829aa0aa636cbcd5861ebc3a081cda45815","source_hash":"cd0498143f8ddb81f650d569a11c16e832dab70e6930facb820e7b6bf2e62145","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2019年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1615,"end":1623,"target_id":"8cd671498d36c8db44b2e3cd0d9119e847e7131e2489f3932b48b6019bc39c20","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1623,"end":1783,"target_id":"29b8721a5e6b05449af50430869452891307dfaf12842a23b69062944b0d1d4f","source_hash":"837d8c32b569edb4670c82c86487c6f3e21d516429b40e3d2f2ec70de0979c09","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至③ 省略\n\n  ④ 空军防空司令部命令部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第五条“（维持军纪）”的标题改为“（维持军纪）”，该条除标题外的其他部分中的“军纪”改为“军纪”。 \n\n  省略⑤至<16>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002271-205314-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1783,"end":1789,"target_id":"3958e66271879aed4a7e5748453adb0bc9440832ed4088ece00579b2726dff7b","source_hash":"558c6d17486d0d6657212a87561377425c0a8eb8bdfabed29d681808202e17af","text":"第 4 条省略"}]}